<title>HONG KONG: Siu-fung Ceramics suspended shares trade.</title>
<headline>Siu-fung Ceramics suspended shares trade.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Siu-fung Ceramics Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Shares of the ceramics and machinery manufacturer ended one cent up to HK$0.65 per share on Monday on volume of 22.75 million shares worth HK$14.95 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
